{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>The Buzite</b> — from the descendants of Nahor, Abraham's brother: \"and Buz his brother\" (Genesis 22:21). It is also possible that he was from the mother's family, like Jair son of Manasseh, who is from the descendants of Judah, as is explicitly stated in Chronicles." "<b>Of the family of Ram</b> — the likely possibility is that he is the father of Amminadab, and he is from the children of Israel." "<b>His anger burned against Job</b> — because he justified himself more than Elohim and condemned HaShem, speaking out of his overwhelming grief."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:13.826108899Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}